 "description": "<p>A preppy JK onesie in chiffon and mesh, gray, one size for 40-60 kg. The onesie format takes the JK aesthetic - collar, cut - into a single garment with a tie decoration at the throat.</p>\n<p>The chiffon-mesh combination keeps it sheer and breathable, which is the lingerie register this listing lives in. Gray is the only colorway, the softest read in the school genre.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: chiffon and mesh</li>\n<li>Includes: onesie, tie</li>\n<li>Style: preppy JK, sheer</li>\n<li>Color: gray</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. The one-garment JK option when a two-piece set is more than the night needs.</p>\n",
